OFFER OF EXCLUSIVE HOUSES IN THE OGRODY ESTATE SURROUNDED BY GREENERY We invite you to familiarize yourself with the unique offer of modern houses in the intimate Osiedle Ogrody investment, where luxury, functionality and attention to detail create a space ideal for living. LOCATION The Ogrody estate is located in a quiet, green part of the city, offering the perfect combination of proximity to nature and the convenience of city life. This unique place is a great choice for people who value the harmony of everyday life, where silence and privacy meet easy access to the most important points of the city infrastructure. The surroundings of the estate are dominated by modern, elegant single-family houses, which create an aesthetic and coherent neighborhood, providing a pleasant and well-kept landscape. Some premises offer a picturesque view of the nearby forest, which emphasizes the unique character of this investment, allowing residents to enjoy the proximity of nature every day. The investment was planned with privacy and peace in mind - the estate is located in a quiet place, away from the hustle and bustle of the city, which guarantees privacy and comfort of life. At the same time, its location provides quick and convenient access to Krakow, which makes it an attractive proposition for people working in the city but wanting to live away from the hustle and bustle. In addition, there are schools, kindergartens, shops and other service points in the immediate vicinity, making everyday duties easier and less time-consuming. The proximity of green areas and convenient access to urban infrastructure make Osiedle Ogrody an ideal place for both families and people looking for a balance between work and relaxation in a friendly environment. INVESTMENT Osiedle Ogrody is an intimate complex of 12 single-family houses, designed with comfort and a modern lifestyle in mind: 4 semi-detached houses (usable area approx. 150 m\xb2). 8 terraced houses (usable area approx. 120 m\xb2). On the estate you will find: Closed, fenced space with electrically controlled entrance gates. Green area available to residents. Recreational space with well-kept gardens and terraces. The investment stands out with its modern design and high aesthetics of the buildings, which harmonize with the surroundings, creating a unique atmosphere. A well-thought-out spatial development plan ensures that every resident has privacy and spaciousness, while at the same time the entire estate constitutes a coherent, functional whole. HIGH STANDARD OF FINISHING Each house in the Ogrody Estate is characterized by the highest quality materials and modern technological solutions: Large glazing and triple-glazed window joinery. Elevation made of aluminum facade, giving the buildings elegance and durability. Underfloor heating throughout the house with a Wi-Fi module allowing remote control of the temperature in each room. Mechanical ventilation with heat recovery and installation for air conditioning. Garage door with electric drive and additional parking space in front of the house. Each home is equipped with a video intercom, ensuring safety and convenience. The height of the rooms is 270 cm, which gives a feeling of spaciousness. The estate is lit with modern lamps, including driveway lamps. HOUSE NO. 1 - ROOM LAYOUT GROUND FLOOR – functional living area: Spacious living room with large windows, connected to an open kitchen. Office or guest room – the perfect place for remote work or for guests. Practical pantry, toilet and entrance to the garage directly from the hall. Garage with boiler room FIRST FLOOR – comfortable private space: Three bedrooms, including a master bedroom with private dressing room. Laundry room and spacious bathroom with modern equipment. Each room has access to a balcony or terrace, providing a private relaxation area. ATTIC – additional potential: Unused attic with the possibility of adaptation to any space (e.g. studio, gym), equipped with roof windows. This is a place where modernity is combined with functionality and aesthetics at the highest level. Ideal for families looking for comfort and safety in a peaceful environment. We invite you to view it! Contact us and arrange a convenient date for the presentation – feel the unique atmosphere of Osiedle Ogrody on your own skin. / PRICE: PLN 1,350,000.00 The price includes a garage within the building and one above-ground parking space. CONTACT REGARDING THE OFFER: MB ESTATES Patrici
