ENGLISH VERSION BELOW:

We are pleased to present a cozy, bright and spacious semi-detached house for sale with an area of \u200b\u200b120 m2 (98 m2 of usable area) in Krakow at ul. Wielogórska, which is located on an intimate, fenced investment consisting of 3 identical houses. The house is finished with attention to detail, with very good materials and is suitable for immediate living. The house includes a garden with well-kept greenery with an area of \u200b\u200b300 m2, which is adjacent to the Bielañsko-Tyniecki Landscape Park, which gives a sense of intimacy and allows you to relax in your free time.

LOCATION:
The property is located in Krakow at ul. Wielogórska in a closed, monitored housing estate. This location is a very strong point of this offer - the house is located right next to the Tyniecki Forest (a forest area on the Tynieckie Hills, which is part of the Bielañsko-Tyniecki Landscape Park), where numerous hiking and cycling trails have been laid, thanks to which amateurs of outdoor sports will be able to after crossing the threshold of your own home, find yourself on your daily training or recreation route. The house is located 10 km from the Main Market Square. In close proximity (Tyniec) there is a primary school, a kindergarten, a pharmacy and a grocery store (4 minutes by car).

COMMUNICATION:
In the close vicinity, there is a bus stop for lines 112 and 612, from where you can get to any place in Krakow. Very good communication for motorists and two-wheelers. Two parking spaces belong to the house (possibility of adding a garage). Entrance to the estate through a gate controlled by a remote control.
HOUSE:
On the ground floor we will find:
- a very bright living room with direct access to the terrace and garden,
- open bright kitchen,
- a toilet
- technical room (storage)

On the floor:
- 2 large bedrooms
- a bright bathroom with a shower
- 2 balconies

In the attic:
- the possibility of adapting the attic for an additional room

EQUIPMENT:
The house is sold with all the equipment that is currently in it - more details on place.

ADDITIONAL INFORMATION:
- separate property with a land and mortgage register
- alarm installation with SMS notification
- intercom on the ground floor and first floor
- fast internet (fiber optic)
- floor heating in the kitchen and both bathrooms (gas)
- the possibility of installing a photovoltaic installation
- quiet and peaceful surroundings

FEES:
The monthly cost of maintaining the house is about PLN 500 - 700

CONTACT:
estate agency
Wawrzyniec Biborski


For over twelve years, we have been helping our clients in choosing their dream apartment, sharing our knowledge, thanks to which we offer assistance in:

